  (text "RV1106 SoM: powered from the system +5V rail (battery boost). J50 USB-C brings in VBUS (charge input) + its own USB data + microSD. UART to the S3 over J1 (RV_TX/RX/CTRL). VERIFY the Core1106 castellated pinout vs the Luckfox datasheet (symbol pin numbers are placeholders)." (at 45 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid 923ceab2-9081-4a7e-8461-3e7df1dea47c))
